Exclude experimental-search (tantivy) from WASM builds

tantivy uses mmap-based disk indexing via fs4 -> rustix 1.x -> errno,
which does not compile for wasm32-unknown-unknown. The errno crate
explicitly rejects this target at compile time.

Backport the upstream removal of experimental-search from matrix-sdk-ffi
(present in upstream commit b07069170):
- Move the experimental-search matrix-sdk feature to the non-WASM target
  dependency section so native builds retain search capability
- Remove the search source module and all search API usages from
  matrix-sdk-ffi source (disk-based search is meaningless in a browser)

